# The PR 8 move: every file in src/lib's layer folders to its home in SPEC §6.3/§6.4, tests next to
# their code, e2e regrouped by feature. Run with scripts/refactor/move.ts (see its header).
#
# Naming: components keep their names. A module that a later PR splits or merges lands whole in its
# primary home under its old basename (stores/User.ts -> auth/User.ts, models/Configuration.ts ->
# config/Configuration.ts). Any other module takes the name the spec gives it (api/client.ts,
# query/build.ts, banners per §6.3.1), else a lowerCamel name in its folder, or types.ts when it only
# holds types. Tests take their module's new name: `foo.test.ts` (Vitest node project) or
# `Foo.svelte.test.ts` (client project, every component test).

